  "The 'BIG BLUE (11)' heading covers the AT-ATs/AT-STs, capital ships and bounty-hunter ships; it is a section header, not a card.",
  "Endor system and sites dested to the Dark Endor printings (Endor (Dark), Endor: Bunker (Dark), Endor: Back Door (Dark), Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark)).",
  "Posted 'D2 Docking Bay' dested Death Star II: Docking Bay; '4-Lom w/Gun' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Captain Galad Pellaeon' dested Captain Gilad Pellaeon; '... in ship' rows dested the Boba Fett In Slave I, Bossk In Hound's Tooth, Dengar In Punishing One and Zuckuss In Mist Hunter combo starships.",
  "Posted 'Force Lighting' dested Force Lightning; 'The Circle Is Not Complete' dested The Circle Is Now Complete; 'There Will Be Hell To Pay' (listed among the Interrupts) dested the Effect There'll Be Hell To Pay.",
